{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cooking game with a fantasy twist! Open your own pizzeria deep inside a dungeon, serving weary adventurers who come to rest and refuel between their quests and bounties.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834910/extras/d4fabdcf015f63585d63f6cdc641fa25.avif?t=1774568692\" width=1560 height=500 /></span>Knead the dough, spread the sauce, and prepare\u2026 <strong>the rat chunks?!</strong> Ingredients are strange and scarce down here - but they have a certain gourmet appeal to those with an open mind. You\u2019ll have to make do with what you can trade and scavenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834910/extras/bf4f1c830eebfced37b9e1c2765f2eaa.poster.avif?t=1774568692\" width=490 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834910/extras/bf4f1c830eebfced37b9e1c2765f2eaa.webm?t=1774568692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834910/extras/a78a9e44e8258a6edbdd16cb3454ee4b.avif?t=1774568692\" width=1560 height=628 /></span>As you grow more skilled in the pizza arts, you\u2019ll unlock new ingredients and recipes. Manage your stock and use your time wisely to keep your patrons fed and happy. Along the way, you\u2019ll get to know the adventurers who visit your shop - their stories, their relationships with each other, and their reasons for delving into this dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834910/extras/2b78994c4a2364d21eac134d168f4a85.poster.avif?t=1774568692\" width=490 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834910/extras/2b78994c4a2364d21eac134d168f4a85.webm?t=1774568692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834910/extras/5f97b6bcd24599ba7be221721ee51b0a.avif?t=1774568692\" width=1560 height=628 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With simple and intuitive mouse-only controls, anyone can enjoy Dungeon Pizza. Mistakes never result in a penalty or failure, so everyone can make pizza their own way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834910/extras/177027ac29eceec0554492e4a766a43f.poster.avif?t=1774568692\" width=490 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834910/extras/177027ac29eceec0554492e4a766a43f.webm?t=1774568692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834910/extras/55fec95e2dbf1dfb9f5b61757bd6c38f.avif?t=1774568692\" width=800 height=300 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3834910?t=1774568692","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3834910?t=1774568692","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834910/488fb74f99b77285a4deccfdfa94b739d1d1ca25/ca