ll unlock new ingredients and recipes. Manage your stock and use your time wisely to keep your patrons fed and happy. Along the way, you\u2019ll get to know the adventurers who visit your shop - their stories, their relationships with each other, and their reasons for delving into this dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834910/extras/2b78994c4a2364d21eac134d168f4a85.poster.avif?t=1774568692\" width=490 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834910/extras/2b78994c4a2364d21eac134d168f4a85.webm?t=1774568692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834910/extras/5f97b6bcd24599ba7be221721ee51b0a.avif?t=1774568692\" width=1560 height=628 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With simple and intuitive mouse-only controls, anyone can enjoy Dungeon Pizza. Mistakes never result in a penalty or failure, so everyone can make pizza their own way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834910/extras/177027ac29eceec0554492e4a766a43f.poster.avif?t=1774568692\" width=490 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834910/extras/177027ac29eceec0554492e4a766a43f.webm?t=1774568692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834910/extras/55fec95e2dbf1